00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.010
See that speck out there in the middle?

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:44.720
That's the Horse Davis Ranch headquarters where we live.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.820
It took us years of work and war and trouble to get this cow range whipped,

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.760
and we thought we had it done.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:56.770
Then one night a strange thing happened that we didn't know how to explain.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.460
We saw no harm in it then.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:07.160
