in a hurry. They'd bother because they weren't ready to ride on. They came here to do something,

01:06:50.820 --> 01:06:56.030
and they covered it up so they could stay and get it done. We could only prove it. A corpse will

01:06:56.030 --> 01:06:59.970
prove it. Even if everything's like you say, we couldn't find the body.

01:07:00.030 --> 01:07:05.000
they could have buried him anyplace than a hundred miles or they could have buried him right there

01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:13.980
maybe he's been there all this time i gotta go there and bust in i figured i only got until

01:07:13.980 --> 01:07:20.060
morning what better bet for you is just to ride until your horse drops well if i don't find anything

01:07:20.060 --> 01:07:25.410
then i will go on i've got to stop and try this one more thing i'm coming with you oh no you're

01:07:25.410 --> 01:07:28.700
not i only told you so you know what to expect boom cat

01:08:02.620 --> 01:08:04.280
You've got to go back. Your father will follow you.

01:08:04.680 --> 01:08:07.280
He'll follow me anyway. I left a message telling him where we went.

01:08:07.440 --> 01:08:09.560
Oh, great guns, Megan. What did you do that for?

01:08:09.620 --> 01:08:11.180
I'll never have time to find anything now.

01:08:11.360 --> 01:08:12.760
Of course you will if we get started.

01:08:13.250 --> 01:08:14.470
Ain't there no way to get rid of you?

01:08:14.650 --> 01:08:17.230
No. Can't you see you'll need me when he gets here?

01:08:17.350 --> 01:08:19.480
I'll help you all I can. Come on.

01:08:19.580 --> 01:08:20.620
No, sir. You ain't going.

01:08:20.880 --> 01:08:22.160
Oh, yes, I am.

01:08:22.320 --> 01:08:23.160
Oh, no, you ain't.

01:08:23.200 --> 01:08:23.860
You want a bat?

01:08:24.020 --> 01:08:26.200
Yeah, anything. Your lad go on, and that's fine.

01:08:30.440 --> 01:08:31.360
Throw me the end of your rope.

01:08:32.770 --> 01:08:33.130
Here.

01:08:35.380 --> 01:08:37.820
Keep your eyes peeled now.

01:08:46.450 --> 01:08:47.170
Nothing pull?

01:08:47.350 --> 01:08:48.640
Of course he will.

01:08:53.750 --> 01:08:54.450
All right, take it away.

01:09:35.470 --> 01:09:35.990
What are you doing?

01:09:36.980 --> 01:09:37.740
Find the lamp.

01:09:51.260 --> 01:09:53.860
This dust, how would they get it spread all over?

01:09:54.060 --> 01:09:54.740
How do I know?

01:09:54.800 --> 01:09:55.940
Maybe they threw it in with a shovel.

01:09:57.370 --> 01:09:58.570
It does look kind of funny.

01:10:00.570 --> 01:10:01.710
There's rocks in it.

01:10:07.540 --> 01:10:08.320
Here's where it lay.

01:10:08.640 --> 01:10:13.130
See that dark stain? That's his blood.

01:10:13.950 --> 01:10:15.090
Then it is all true.

01:10:15.350 --> 01:10:16.090
Of course it's true.

01:10:17.860 --> 01:10:19.120
I've got to find him. I've got to.

01:10:19.490 --> 01:10:20.990
If I have to tear down this whole place.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:30.640
I heard horses.

01:10:32.400 --> 01:10:33.400
Guess I didn't though.

01:10:34.320 --> 01:10:35.260
It's awful quiet.

01:10:41.270 --> 01:10:41.950
It's most morning.

01:10:42.900 --> 01:10:44.880
I can see a little streak of mustard in the east.

01:10:46.410 --> 01:10:48.430
It's what those brush wolves are singing at.

01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:54.140
Oh, there's no use going on.

01:10:54.240 --> 01:10:54.720
There's nothing here.

01:10:56.590 --> 01:10:57.250
Bloodstained proof.

01:10:57.390 --> 01:10:58.950
Oh, they'd say you spilled something.

01:11:03.450 --> 01:11:04.290
What are we gonna do?

01:11:14.200 --> 01:11:15.020
I guess I gotta run.

01:11:15.220 --> 01:11:18.330
I was hoping too hard, I guess.

01:11:19.740 --> 01:11:21.220
I was sure it was here, but it ain't.

01:11:22.180 --> 01:11:23.120
No, it ain't here.

01:11:24.230 --> 01:11:26.710
It's in the canyon under a ton of cave-down dirt.

01:11:27.740 --> 01:11:29.900
Someday a flash flood will wash up a scuttlebutt.

01:11:30.060 --> 01:11:32.750
20 miles downstream, but not soon.

01:11:33.840 --> 01:11:34.600
Robert, Megan!

01:11:36.830 --> 01:11:48.140
Stick close to me. They'll be right on us.

01:11:52.530 --> 01:11:53.690
We got into the brush. Get after them.

01:12:04.476 --> 01:12:05.316
Thank you.

01:12:32.520 --> 01:12:32.840
You heard?

01:12:33.180 --> 01:12:33.820
All right.

01:12:38.220 --> 01:12:39.320
Milo man's got our horses.

01:12:40.360 --> 01:12:41.140
Where is he now?

01:12:41.850 --> 01:12:42.690
Look inside the ruins,

01:12:42.830 --> 01:12:43.890
we'll get in there as soon as he's gone.

01:12:44.270 --> 01:12:44.470
Why?

01:12:45.660 --> 01:12:47.340
Only safe place, he's looked in there already.

01:13:05.690 --> 01:13:07.030
I wish Pa'd come.

01:13:08.610 --> 01:13:10.090
They're sure to find us.

01:13:10.330 --> 01:13:10.930
No, they won't.

01:13:13.860 --> 01:13:15.250
Gonna be here forever?

01:13:20.090 --> 01:13:20.950
Maybe quite a while.

01:13:21.300 --> 01:13:22.920
Might as well just figure we live here, I guess.

01:13:25.090 --> 01:13:26.210
Wouldn't be so bad.

01:13:27.190 --> 01:13:27.590
What would?

01:13:28.660 --> 01:13:29.320
Living here.

01:13:30.920 --> 01:13:34.320
fix it up real pretty. It had walls,

01:13:34.700 --> 01:13:36.990
floor. No job to fix that. I could do it

01:13:36.990 --> 01:13:39.400
with my own hands. Glass in the windows?

01:13:39.820 --> 01:13:41.280
Sure. I know how to do things like that.

01:13:41.420 --> 01:13:44.940
I know how to cook and make rugs

01:13:44.940 --> 01:13:48.360
and everything. No, I don't want to think. Why?

01:13:51.200 --> 01:13:53.120
Nothing good can happen. I'm a murderer, everybody thinks.

01:13:54.110 --> 01:13:57.760
I don't. I know.

01:14:00.120 --> 01:14:01.740
Just keep thinking, if only things would come different.

01:14:02.040 --> 01:14:03.060
But they are different.

01:14:03.440 --> 01:14:05.400
They stood right there and said he did it.

01:14:05.800 --> 01:14:08.080
He killed Jim Shell, and you're in the clear.

01:14:13.390 --> 01:14:15.510
I'm a smiling man, anyway.

01:14:16.660 --> 01:14:17.460
I thought I heard Will.

01:14:18.500 --> 01:14:19.220
Don't hear him now.

01:14:19.890 --> 01:14:20.450
There's the roper.

01:14:24.050 --> 01:14:24.770
Look inside.

01:14:25.540 --> 01:14:26.140
Keep back against him.

01:14:28.460 --> 01:14:28.800
Come on.

01:14:35.470 --> 01:14:37.530
Coach Davis, come all right. He's only a little way out.

01:14:37.890 --> 01:14:38.110
Along?

01:14:38.500 --> 01:14:40.480
Two men with him. Pat Farrell's coming up.

01:14:40.760 --> 01:14:41.880
Take the horses around behind.

01:14:46.660 --> 01:14:47.400
Gonna be all right.

01:14:48.820 --> 01:14:49.820
Everything's gonna be all right.

01:14:54.740 --> 01:14:55.520
There they are.

01:15:00.600 --> 01:15:20.060
Hold your fire. Let them come you fool easy shot. I've waited for this many years if you shoot before I tell you

01:15:20.060 --> 01:15:21.980
I'll kill you in the same half second

