Abbey, don't you mind beating me?

01:15:34.860 --> 01:15:35.520
Well, I don't.

01:15:40.110 --> 01:15:42.190
Kellers will hold their fire until nobody can miss.

01:15:43.060 --> 01:15:43.680
Gotta let him know.

01:15:43.960 --> 01:15:44.800
That's no good.

01:15:45.110 --> 01:15:46.330
Pa would think you were signaling.

01:15:46.660 --> 01:15:48.060
Not if I put it close enough to his ear.

01:15:55.530 --> 01:15:56.650
What's that came from the roots?

01:15:57.040 --> 01:15:58.440
Nah, the echo fools you.

01:15:58.820 --> 01:15:59.560
From the ridge.

01:16:00.030 --> 01:16:01.730
When he's tired of that, he'll come on again.

01:16:04.580 --> 01:16:07.140
Dixie, Frank, throw a couple of shots down there to hold his interest.

01:16:07.940 --> 01:16:09.400
I'm going around the long way by the canyon.

01:16:33.260 --> 01:16:46.120
They just lie up there and plunk bullets in them old adobe walls.

01:16:46.920 --> 01:16:48.140
You think they've sent for more?

01:16:48.140 --> 01:16:48.740
Megan, look!

01:16:49.140 --> 01:16:57.340
Who thinks I'm in there?

01:16:59.130 --> 01:16:59.970
