01:17:04.920 --> 01:17:06.320
They've got to warn him.

01:17:08.110 --> 01:17:09.230
If he'll answer, then they'll kill him.

01:17:09.970 --> 01:17:11.290
It'll happen any second.

01:17:13.460 --> 01:17:14.160
Gotta go out there.

01:17:15.340 --> 01:17:16.060
At least make him know.

01:17:17.940 --> 01:17:18.460
Stay back!

01:17:33.360 --> 01:17:34.840
That's Gooncat. He ain't inside.

01:17:35.260 --> 01:17:36.560
Isn't that a gunman in there?

01:17:36.660 --> 01:17:38.060
Keep shooting. That's all we can do.

01:17:38.200 --> 01:17:39.240
It ain't all I can do.

01:17:39.380 --> 01:17:40.540
You can't get to him.

01:17:40.760 --> 01:17:43.380
I can't lay here and see the old man get dry ghosts.

01:18:07.740 --> 01:18:25.050
the turns drop your guns get up low face the wall i'll go easy to the door go up setting us up for

01:18:25.050 --> 01:18:29.320
the guns on the ridge yeah

01:18:30.380 --> 01:18:31.860
I thought you'd remember me.

01:18:32.390 --> 01:18:43.320
You told me Bob Jessup was in the pen.

01:18:43.940 --> 01:18:44.300
That's right.

01:18:45.150 --> 01:18:46.210
Or I'd have been here long.

01:18:47.490 --> 01:18:48.610
Him, I recognize that.

01:18:48.850 --> 01:18:50.690
I saw his brother die in his arms.

01:18:50.960 --> 01:18:51.240
Defense.

01:18:52.340 --> 01:18:54.850
But you, you must have been about 13 then.

01:18:55.370 --> 01:18:56.510
You remember me.

01:18:56.710 --> 01:18:59.460
