01:19:27.000 --> 01:19:27.660
Handle him easy.

01:19:28.700 --> 01:19:28.940
Yeah.

01:19:30.220 --> 01:19:32.020
Here on, he can have anything I got in the world.

01:19:32.920 --> 01:19:34.500
You better pray he can use it.

01:19:34.750 --> 01:19:37.490
You came here to kill him and he gave you your life on a plate.

01:19:38.710 --> 01:19:43.250
From now on, never be without friends, without a home.
